      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pretty much what it says on the tin. &nbsp;There are tons of series listed now, split amongst all the various cards. &nbsp;Which one goes in your weekly pull file?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For me, I think it's \"Emigrant's Song\". &nbsp;I really like the interplay between Expatriette and the Citizens, and to have The Scholar making an appearance? &nbsp;Yes, please! &nbsp;It reminds me very much of \"Huntress--Cry for Blood\", which featured her with The Question, and those are two of my favorite DC characters.</p>",
