      "id": 56219,
      "name": "EvanDan55",
      "username": "EvanDan55",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-21T17:26:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I also love the image on one of Scholar's cards, where he's helping Expatriette up, after she's been pasted all over the wall. &nbsp;Touching, and very \"in-character\" for the pair.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I, too, love this card. I honestly think this is supposed to be Scholar bringing Expatriette back from the brink of death, or even just complete resuscitation from death. I really get the impression that Expatriette and Scholar have a lot of interaction, since they're both featured in similarly-titled stories \"Emigrant's Song\" and \"Vagabond's Tale.\" I'd love to see more stories about them.</p>\n<p>But yeah, anything about Expatriette.</p>\n<p>Anything focusing on Unity and Tachyon.</p>\n<p>Anything featuring battles between Fanatic and Apostate.</p>\n<p>And Prime Wardens <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#1</span>.</p>",
