      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/b782af/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-25T10:17:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I only just received and started the core set (enhanced edition), but from what I've seen of the quotes so far...</p><p>I'd love to see the Absolute Zero issue of \"A Day in the Life,\" honestly. Zero seems to come off as really angry and/or vicious, but there's also plenty of snark and combat pragmatism thrown into what he does...must be a coping mechanism. Would just love to see how that would play out in an actual comic book format.</p>",
