      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-01T19:29:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For solo heroes, it's all about Tachyon. &nbsp;However, as I am more of a team book fan, Prime Wardens sounds like a solid call - less the initial fight against Akash, and more the later developments. &nbsp;Other than Haka, those people all mostly seem lke lone wolves, so watching the degree to whch they one anothers' struggles wth thngs like Apostate and the Maernians rejecting Tempest would be really&nbsp;interesting.</p>",
