      "created_at": "2013-04-02T04:33:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The one shot \"The Wraith - Science And Progress\" is pretty tempting. That hair dryer cracks me up every time I see it (I know it appears in the Realm of Discord's cards and La Capitan's cards, probably a few other places as well)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But I'd have to go with the \"A Day In The Life\" series, too. I love those little examinations of everyday moments.</p>",
